# Records docs/demo/http.gif from a real run: `vhs docs/demo/http.tape` from the repo root.
Output docs/demo/http.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 440
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 22ms

Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' && uv sync -q && source .venv/bin/activate` Enter
Sleep 2s
Type `python -m constrained_generation_library serve --port 18305 >/dev/null 2>&1 &` Enter
Sleep 2s
Sleep 8.0s
Type `clear` Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Type `curl -s localhost:18305/validate -d '{"text": "{\"name\":\"a\",\"age\":3,\"active\":true,\"role\":\"user\"}"}'; echo` Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type `curl -s localhost:18305/generate -d '{"seed": 7}'; echo` Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type `curl -s localhost:18305/report; echo` Enter
Sleep 3s
Hide
Type `kill %1` Enter
Sleep 1s
